                "custom_liquid_4zNNiH": {
                  "type": "custom-liquid",
                  "name": "Product Title",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  SHEENE — Custom Liquid block 1 of 6: Product Title\n  Paste this whole file into a \"Custom Liquid\" block on the Product page,\n  first in the order (Title → Price → Shipping → Quantity → Add to cart → Buy it now).\n  Dynamic: pulls product.title automatically, works on every product.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<h1 class=\"sh-product-title\">{{ product.title }}</h1>\n\n<style>\n  .sh-product-title {\n    font-family: var(--font-heading-family, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);\n    /* Fluid size: scales smoothly between mobile and desktop, no fixed breakpoints */\n    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.35rem + 1.6vw, 2.75rem);\n    margin: 0 0 clamp(0.5rem, 0.4rem + 0.3vw, 0.75rem) 0;\n  }\n</style>"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "custom_liquid_c7bPAB": {
                  "type": "custom-liquid",
                  "name": "Product Price",
                  "settings": {
                    "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  SHEENE — Custom Liquid block 2 of 6: Price row\n  Shows compare-at price (struck through) + current price + \"Sale\" badge,\n  but ONLY when the product is genuinely marked down (compare_at_price > price).\n  If there's no discount, only the plain price shows — no fake strike-through.\n  Uses Shopify's `money` filter, so currency formatting follows your shop\n  settings automatically — never hardcoded as \"Rs.\"\n\n  v2: added a negative top margin to close the extra gap that Shopify's\n  block-to-block spacing was adding above this block, on top of the\n  title's own margin. If this ever looks too tight or too loose after\n  a theme update, adjust the -2.25rem value below — nothing else here\n  depends on it.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% liquid\n  assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant\n  assign on_sale = false\n  if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price\n    assign on_sale = true\n  endif\n%}\n\n<div class=\"sh-price-row\" data-variant-id=\"{{ variant.id }}\">\n  {% if on_sale %}\n    <span class=\"sh-price-compare\">{{ variant.compare_at_price | money }}</span>\n  {% endif %}\n  <span class=\"sh-price-current\">{{ variant.price | money }}</span>\n  {% if on_sale %}\n    <span class=\"sh-price-badge\">Sale</span>\n  {% endif %}\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .sh-price-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: clamp(0.5rem, 0.4rem + 0.3vw, 0.75rem);\n    font-family: var(--font-body-family, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);\n    margin: 0 0 clamp(0.5rem, 0.4rem + 0.3vw, 0.75rem) 0;\n  }\n  .sh-price-compare {\n    color: var(--color-foreground-75, #9A9A9A);\n    text-decoration: line-through;\n    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 0.88rem + 0.3vw, 1.1rem);\n  }\n  .sh-price-current {\n    color: var(--color-foreground, #111111);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1rem + 0.45vw, 1.4rem);\n  }\n  .sh-price-badge {\n    background: var(--color-foreground, #111111);\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-family: var(--font-body-family, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);\n    font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 0.66rem + 0.1vw, 0.8rem);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n    padding: 0.3em 0.65em;\n    border-radius: 0;\n  }\n</style>"
